by Ayesh at 2026-04-10T21:20:22Z

Yeah you are right this wouldn't be the most useful polyfill.

With a const declared, it will be possible to safely call `array_filter` with `$mode = ARRAY_FILTER_USE_VALUE` across all PHP versions:

```php
array_filter($arr, $fn, ARRAY_FILTER_USE_VALUE);
```

`ARRAY_FILTER_USE_VALUE` is the default value, so this declaration makes it a less meaningful.

Please feel free to close this if you think there's no tangible benefit polyflling this constant. I would totally trust your judgement :)

